            "value": "保留照片，清除 App 文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.selectVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Briefly press a photo, hold, then drag across the grid to select continuously. You can also tap to select. Up to 200 photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先短暂按住一张照片，再滑动连续选择；也可以点按选择，最多 200 张。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.orderVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pages sort by capture time. Review the selection and tap a mistake to remove it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片按拍摄时间排序。检查选择，点按移除误选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.generateVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After photos are prepared, tap Generate ZIP and PDF to start file generation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片整理完成后，主动点按生成 ZIP 和 PDF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.cleanVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save the ZIP and confirm it is saved externally before source cleanup. Choose Delete Photos, or Keep Photos and clear only App files. Each needs separate confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先保存 ZIP 并确认外部文件完整，再选择删除原照片，或保留相册照片只清除 App 文件。两种清理都需要单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select 1–200 photos. Tap to select; briefly press, then drag to sweep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 1–200 张照片。点按选择；短暂长按后滑动可连续选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.ai": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hand it to AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交给 AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.aiVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A saved AI ZIP can be shared to an AI conversation. Ask it to summarize, organize or continue working with the lecture. This is a local teaching illustration, not a real share or AI response."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存后的 AI ZIP 可以分享给 AI，并继续让它总结、整理或处理讲座内容。这是本地教学示意，不会真实分享或调用 AI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.aiPrompt": {
